# Iron Man, Master of Machines: "if an artifact entered the battlefield under your control this turn" asks what the permanent
# was as it entered (CR 603.6a), not what it is now. Turn 1 Bot1 casts Iron Man off three Moxen and an Island. Turn 3 he casts
# Grizzly Bears (not an artifact), then I Am Iron Man makes the Bears an artifact creature (and draws a card). The Bears
# entered as a non-artifact, so Iron Man's attack draws nothing: hand 1 (2 would be a draw).

